- New design system: CSS variables, Syne + Space Mono + DM Sans fonts
- Sidebar: dark themed, mobile bottom nav, active state indicators
- Feedcard: realtime Supabase subscriptions for likes + comments
- Feed.jsx: fixed user.following null check bug
- Auth pages: split layout with animated banner
- Quiz: correct/wrong answer highlighting, progress bar, better scoring
- Profile: cleaner layout, box-shadow accent on avatar
- Search: UserCard component, smart recommendations dedup
- Loader: minimal spinner replacing gif
- Global: animations, transitions, scroll styles, selection color
- Mobile: fully responsive across all breakpoints
